 "takeaways": [
  "**|A × B| = AB sin θ** = area of the parallelogram on A and B.",
  "Direction by the **right-hand rule**, perpendicular to both A and B.",
  "Zero for **parallel** or **anti-parallel** vectors; maximum for **perpendicular**."
 ]
